node_modules/
# OCR output cache, keyed by image hash and configuration.
.cache/
# Real screenshots and their labels. Never commit these.
private/
reports/private-*
# Synthetic dictation clips (macOS `say`); regenerated by `npm run voice:generate`.
voice/synthetic/
voice/reports/private-*
# Dictation reports are regenerated in ~20 s by `npm run voice:benchmark`. Only the
# two configurations docs/VOICE.md compares are committed: the previously shipped
# one (examples prompt, raw audio) and the shipped one (vocabulary prompt, prepared).
voice/reports/synthetic-*
!voice/reports/synthetic-examples-raw.md
!voice/reports/synthetic-vocabulary-prepare.md
